            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste the address of a raw WebKit content-blocking `.json` file — the content-blocker projects publish them — and Nifro applies it to every website; empty means no rules.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粘贴一个 WebKit 内容拦截 `.json` 原始文件的地址（内容拦截项目都有发布），Nifro 会把它应用到所有网站；留空表示不用任何规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paused, it costs next to nothing beyond a little memory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂停时，除少量内存外几乎没有开销。"
