    "Report a problem": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "报告问题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset: every setting, every keyboard shortcut, and which display each website is on.\n\nReinstalled: the websites Nifro comes with, in the order it comes with them.\n\nLost: the websites you added yourself, and every change you made to any website. There is no undo.\n\nKept: your logins, the language you picked, and whether Nifro launches at login.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重置：所有设置、所有键盘快捷键，以及每个网站所在的显示器。\n\n重新安装：Nifro 自带的网站，按它自带的顺序。\n\n丢失：你自己添加的网站，以及你对任何网站所做的全部修改。无法撤销。\n\n保留：你的登录状态、你选的语言，以及 Nifro 是否随登录启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore All Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还原所有设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore Nifro to how it shipped?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
