    "Switch to Next Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到下一个网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to Previous Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到上一个网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to Random Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到随机网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switched off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches Nifro to a random website in the list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到列表里的随机一个网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches Nifro to the next website in the list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到列表里的下一个网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches Nifro to the previous website in the list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到列表里的上一个网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address of the player on its own, so the video fills the wallpaper without the navigation, recommendations and comments around it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "播放器单独的地址，视频直接铺满壁纸，没有周围的导航、推荐和评论。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The built-in default playlist cannot be bound to a display, so duplicate it first and bind the copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内置的默认播放列表不能绑定到显示器，所以先复制一份，再绑定这个副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copy gets its own websites, so a region, a stylesheet or a reload interval changed in one list leaves the other alone. It does not copy logins: every site the original is signed in to, the copy is signed out of.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "副本会拿到属于它自己的网站，所以在一个列表里改缩放区域、样式表或刷新间隔，不会影响另一个。它不会复制登录状态：原列表已登录的每个网站，副本都是未登录的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The default for websites that have not answered this themselves, in their own settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有在自己的设置里回答这个问题的网站，用这里的默认值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The page is laid out at the size of the wallpaper, so `100vw` and `100vh` mean that area, and `<html>` carries `is-nifro-app` always and `nifro-is-browsing-mode` while Browsing Mode is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "页面按壁纸的大小排版，所以 `100vw`、`100vh` 指的就是那块区域；`<html>` 上一直有 `is-nifro-app`，浏览模式开着时还有 `nifro-is-browsing-mode`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The wallpaper comes back up on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸会自己回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The websites Nifro comes with go into your default playlist, and a default playlist is made if you do not have one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nifro 自带的网站会进入你的默认播放列表；如果你没有默认播放列表，会新建一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This site sends Nifro to %@ every time it loads. Click to save that address instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个站点每次加载都会把 Nifro 送到 %@。点一下就把那个地址存下来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Title": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标题"
          }
        }
