    "Up to date": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已是最新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use print styles": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用打印样式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the panel's Crop button to move and zoom the wallpaper, and where you leave it is the region — remembered as a place and a magnification rather than a rectangle.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用面板上的 Crop 拖动和缩放壁纸，你停在哪里哪里就是区域——它记住的是位置和倍率，不是一个矩形。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the player-only page": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改用纯播放器页面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Useful with rotation — a news page in the morning, something calmer at night; a window that runs past midnight, 22 to 6, works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配合轮换很好用——早上放新闻，晚上放安静点的；跨过午夜的时段（22 到 6）也可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Username": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用户名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Websites": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Nifro!": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用 Nifro！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When in dark mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "深色模式下"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where a link off this website goes — a site you sign in to wants “In Nifro”, because signing in navigates away from it and the page you come back to is the one you wanted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从这个网站点出去的链接在哪里打开——需要登录的网站要选“在 Nifro 中”，因为登录本身就会跳离它，而你想回到的正是那个页面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether this website may make noise, remembered per website; it mutes the page's audio and video elements, not sound made with the Web Audio API.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个网站能不能出声，按网站分别记住；静音的是页面里的音频和视频元素，不包括用 Web Audio API 生成的声音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whole page": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You could, for example,": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "比如，你可以让它"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom In": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom Out": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缩小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "^[%lld site](inflect: true) · bundled copy, could not reach GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个站点 · 内置副本，连不上 GitHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "^[%lld site](inflect: true) · up to date with GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个站点 · 已与 GitHub 同步"
          }
